A nested quote after a quoted list leaves a marker line lazy

```
> - a
> > c
- tail
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>a</li>
  </ul>
  <blockquote><p>c
- tail</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> 1. a
> > c
1. tail
.
<blockquote>
  <ol>
    <li>a</li>
  </ol>
  <blockquote><p>c
1. tail</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> - a
>  > c
- tail
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>a</li>
  </ul>
  <blockquote><p>c
- tail</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> > - a
> > > c
> - tail
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <ul>
      <li>a</li>
    </ul>
    <blockquote><p>c
- tail</p></blockquote>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```
